# Studio-local build and CLI state.
#
# The repository root `.gitignore` is Workstream A's single-owner file (TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md
# §23.3). `studio/` is a separate application with its own dependency tree and its own
# generated artifacts, so its ignores live with it rather than in A's file.

# `sanity dev` / `sanity build` regenerate this on every run and discard edits to it.
.sanity/

# `sanity build` output. The Studio's bundle never enters the web app's.
dist/

# Dataset exports (`npm run export`, §20). Backups go to owner-controlled storage, not Git —
# and an export carries the full contents of a private dataset.
*.tar.gz
